values (
  'cp-practice-binary-search-tree-115', 'dt-practice-binary-search-tree', null,
  $px$Kth Smallest Element in BST$px$, $px$kth-smallest-in-bst$px$, $px$Medium$px$,
  $px$Given a Binary Search Tree and an integer `K`, find the K-th smallest value (1-indexed).

**Input Format**

The first line contains an integer `M`.
The second line contains `M` space-separated tokens (integers or `null`) — the BST in level order.
The third line contains the integer `K`.

